## Post-V2: Game Implementation

After Plan 25 proves the architecture, the demo games (Pong, Breakout, Asteroids, Pongsteroids, Tetris, Space Invaders, etc.) get reimplemented in V2. Then work begins on the remaining CD50 games.

## CD50 Final Game Count Vision

Current thinking on the final game roster (~50 games total):

| Category | Count | Description |
|----------|-------|-------------|
| **Remakes** | 10 | Faithful recreations of classic arcade games (Pong, Breakout, Asteroids, Space Invaders, Galaga, Tetris, etc.) |
| **Lite Remixes / Originals** | 30 | Light variations on classic formulas — mix-and-match components from remakes, or original concepts built from the same component library |
| **Heavy Remixes / Originals** | 10 | Substantial reimaginings — major mechanic shifts, mashups of multiple games, or fully original games that use the composable architecture |
| **Total** | ~50 | |

This replaces the earlier "10 remakes + remixes" vision. The composable architecture makes the lite/heavy remix scale realistic — each remix is component assembly, not new code.